# Local Worker dev vars for the Sitepins app Worker.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`
# (NEVER commit `.dev.vars` and NEVER put real secrets in this file —
# placeholders only).
#
# IMPORTANT — NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the app at BUILD time
# (`next build`, run inside `opennextjs-cloudflare build`). Setting them in
# wrangler.jsonc [vars] alone does NOT rebuild the app: they must also be
# present in the build environment (shell, CI, or Cloudflare Workers Builds
# dashboard variables) before `pnpm cf:build` runs. Changing one later
# requires a rebuild + redeploy.
#
# --- Build-time (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) — fill in before the first build ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://api.csofts.tech/api/v1
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HP_WS_URL=wss://api.csofts.tech/api/v1/editor/collab
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_URL=https://csofts.tech
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME=Sitepins
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_SLUG=sitepins
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BUCKET_URL=https://media.csofts.tech
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GIT_APP_NAME=<GitHub App slug>
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GITLAB_CLIENT_ID=
#
# --- Server-side secrets (wrangler secret put — see docs/cloudflare-deploy.md) ---
# INTERNAL_API_SECRET=<must match the API Worker's value>
# GITHUB_APP_ID=
# GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY=<full .pem contents, newlines preserved>
# GITLAB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# AI_PROVIDER=groq
# AI_MODEL=
# AI_API_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_EMAIL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_PASSWORD=
